    "visibility" "0"
    "title" "Crossover Platforms"
    "description" "[h1]Crossover Platforms[/h1]
Because I was annoyed with making elevators to go around platforms.
This mod adds 3 new space platforms aimed at improving quality of life when dealing with belts and pipes:
- A Space Belt x Belt crossing platform
- A Space Pipe x Pipe crossing platform
- A Space Belt X Pipe crossing platform

You can place the manually from the hotbar in the [b]Crossings[/b] group.

[h2]Automatic Crossings[/h2]
This mod changes the default behavior when you drag belts or pipes across one another.
Typically the game would attempt to go around the intersecting belt/pipe by making a lift or elevator above or below the current layer to bypass it.
This mod overrides that and will instead automatically select a crossover platform that matches your use case automatically.

The flip key (F by default) swaps which way the crossing's second path runs.

These platforms use the game's default platform and pipe transfer speeds.

[h2]Before you install[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]This mod affects save games.[/b]. Once you install this mod to a save, you cannot play it without it.
[*]Available from the first milestone. This is a QoL mod. Anyone installing this mod knows what they are doing so gating it behind late research would defeat the point. 
[*]Requires Shapez Shifter.
[/list]

Bugs and requests: https://github.com/QuinnBast/Shapez2-Mods/issues
Licensed under Apache 2.0."
    "changenote" "Fixes the mod not appearing at all for players who have the prediction setting turned off."
}
